Modifications in version 1.10.1 (summary; see docs/修复记录.md for details):
  * Fixed startup crashes on Quilt / mismatched loaders (upstream issues #11, #18).
  * Confined the crosshair matrix transform to the whole Gui.renderCrosshair
    method body on Forge 1.20 / 1.20.1 / 1.20.2, so the vanilla crosshair and
    its own CROSSHAIR attack indicator move together, while HUD elements drawn
    outside that method (hotbar, health bars, third-party overlays) are not
    rotated, scaled or displaced (MC百科 comment #30, issues #3 / #6 / #13).
    All original animation values are unchanged.
  * Hardened config parsing (corrupt files fall back to defaults).
  * Guarded optional CameraOverhaul integration against version mismatches.
  * Fixed paired matrix push/pop with a fallback restore, duplicate event
    registration, and swallowed entrypoint exceptions.
  * Removed a dead TaCZ Maven dependency and unused Fabric-side TaCZ code.
  * Removed a leftover @Overwrite that modified the window title.
  * Corrected version / license metadata and version mapping.

The project source and build instructions are available in this repository;
see README.md. The partial sources JAR alone does not contain the full project.

